# Domain (`ForensicsAnalyzer.Domain`)

- No project/package references. No EF, ASP.NET, MediatR, or AutoMapper.
- Entities inherit `BaseEntity` (`Id`, `CreatedAt`, `UpdatedAt`, `MetadataJson`) unless there is an approved exception.
- Soft-delete via `ISoftDelete`; keep domain rules in the entity, not in controllers.
- New entity, enum, or base type = architecture-gate question + docs in `PROJECT_DOCUMENTATION.md` and `docs/features/` if it is a product concept.

```csharp
// ❌ BAD
public class Case : BaseEntity { public SqlConnection Db { get; set; } }

// ✅ GOOD
public class Case : BaseEntity, ISoftDelete { public string Name { get; set; } = string.Empty; }
```
